.Dd July 8, 2026
.Dt DEPLOY_SYSTEM 8
.Os FreeBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm deploy_system
.Nd deploy a system from zbamidbar archive to zbereshit for boot
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Fl s Ar name
.Op Fl h
.Op Fl d
.Op Fl n
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm
utility is part of the parasa framework for FreeBSD system management.
It deploys a named system by sending a foundation ZFS archive from
.Pa zbamidbar
to
.Pa zbereshit ,
then applies system-specific state via a git checkout of the
corresponding system branch.
.Pp
The deployment proceeds as follows:
.Bl -enum
.It
Read the foundation name from
.Pa minhag/systems/ Ns Ao Ar name Ac Ns Pa /*.foundation .
.It
Find the foundation commit that the
.Pa system/ Ns Ao Ar name Ac
branch forks from in
.Pa sinai.git .
That commit's message is the artifact name and ZFS snapshot tag.
.It
Send the foundation archive using
.Xr zfs-send 8
from
.Pa zbamidbar/sinai.zfs/foundations/ Ns Ao Ar foundation Ac Ns @ Ns Ao Ar artifact Ac
and receive it into
.Pa zbereshit/systems/ Ns Ao Ar name Ac
using
.Xr zfs-recv 8 .
.It
Run
.Cm git checkout
of the
.Pa system/ Ns Ao Ar name Ac
branch to apply system-specific state such as
.Xr fstab 5 .
.It
If
.Fl n
is specified, configure
.Xr nextboot 8
for a one-shot boot into the deployed system.
.El
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width "-s NAME"
.It Fl h
Print a usage summary and exit.
.It Fl d
Dry run.
Show what would be done without making any changes.
.It Fl s Ar name
Specify the system name.
This option is required.
.It Fl n
Set
.Xr nextboot 8
after a successful deploy.
This configures a one-shot boot into the deployed system that
automatically reverts on failure.
When this flag is used,
.Cm zfs set -u mountpoint=/
is applied to the target dataset and
.Xr nextboot 8
is invoked with:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
nextboot -e vfs.root.mountfrom="zfs:zbereshit/systems/<name>"
.Ed
.Pp
If the session is interactive, the user is prompted to reboot.
.El
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width "zbamidbar/sinai.zfs/foundations/<foundation>"
.It Pa minhag/systems/ Ns Ao Ar name Ac Ns Pa /*.foundation
Foundation descriptor for the named system.
.It Pa zbamidbar/sinai.git
Git repository containing
.Pa system/ Ns Ao Ar name Ac
and
.Pa foundation/ Ns Ao Ar name Ac
branches.
.It Pa zbamidbar/sinai.zfs/foundations/ Ns Ao Ar foundation Ac
ZFS archive of the named foundation.
.It Pa zbereshit/systems/ Ns Ao Ar name Ac
Target dataset where the system is deployed for boot.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr new_foundation 8 ,
.Xr new_system 8 ,
.Xr nextboot 8 ,
.Xr zfs-recv 8 ,
.Xr zfs-send 8
.Sh AUTHORS
The
.Nm
utility is part of the parasa framework.
